			<h1 style="font-size: 6rem; color: #fff; line-height: 0.1;">i'm <span class="accent">brahm!</span></h1>
			<h3 class="font-thai">บราห์ม วงษ์วันทนีย์</h3>
		</div>
	</Splash>

	<Block theme="light">
		<h3>about me ></h3>
		i’m <b>narawutti wongwandanee</b>, but i go by <b>brahm</b>. i’m an 3rd year computer science undergraduate student at the <b>university of british columbia</b>! 
		i’m interested game design and ui/ux. i’m also a part-time illustrator.<br><br>

		i’m always looking for new opportunities! if you’d like to reach out, please contact me via my email: <span class="font-mono">wnarawutti@gmail.com</span>
	</Block>

	<Block theme="dark">
		<h3>extracurricular involvement</h3>
		<b>hello world!</b> hello world!
	</Block>

	<Block theme="light">
		<h3>illustration gallery</h3>
